OL,4,CCouncil 'no further forward' with road 
OL,5,Cclosure                                
OL,6,GTwo months after deciding a damaged    
OL,7,Groad into a remote village should be   
OL,8,Gclosed permanently, the local          
OL,9,Gauthority has not started the court    
OL,10,Gproceedings required to move the plan  
OL,11,Gforward.                               
OL,13,FPart of Saunders Avenue, linking the   
OL,14,FA68 and Hamsterley near Bishop         
OL,15,FAuckland, was shut in January 2023     
OL,16,Fafter the road surface collapsed into  
OL,17,Fthe River Wear.                        
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
