OL,4,CBuilding secured for writing and       
OL,5,Cpublishing centre                      
OL,6,GA Grade II listed city centre building 
OL,7,Gis set to become a national centre for 
OL,8,Gwriting and publishing.                
OL,10,FThe Old Post Office in St Nicholas     
OL,11,FStreet, Newcastle, was bought for      
OL,12,F#3.65m by charity New Writing North    
OL,13,Fand Northumbria University. Work will  
OL,14,Fbegin in 2027, with the ambition that  
OL,15,Fit will be fully opened to the public  
OL,16,Fin 2029.                               
OL,18,FThe centre has received more than      
OL,19,F#10.7m in funding and wants to bring   
OL,20,Ftogether writers, publishers,          
OL,21,Fstudents, and local communities under  
OL,22,Fone roof.                         G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
