OL,4,CWeapons link renaming call for         
OL,5,Cuniversity building                    
OL,6,GA Newcastle University academic has    
OL,7,Gcalled for the establishment's oldest  
OL,8,Gbuilding to be renamed after research  
OL,9,Guncovered new information about links  
OL,10,Gto weapons dealing during the American 
OL,11,GCivil War.                             
OL,13,FA recent study found 19th century      
OL,14,Findustrialist and engineer William     
OL,15,FArmstrong, after whom the building was 
OL,16,Fnamed, sold more arms to the US        
OL,17,FConfederate pro-slavery forces than    
OL,18,Fpreviously thought.                    
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
